  missionName: THE FROZEN CAMP
  missionType: SABOTAGE
  briefing: The artillery camp covers the road. Suzu has a ridge above it and Tsuru
    has a ravine below. The fires will burn slow in this cold, and the camp will
    have time to notice.
  debrief: The camp goes up. The mountain shivers.
